    service's StateDirectory. The code still defaulted to
    /var/lib/stained-glass/speech, which ProtectSystem=strict makes read-only,
    so every download and removal died on a real machine. dictate-test now
    checks the two agree. Verified in a VM: download as root, recognition,
    removal.

